      "value": "\n\n\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per 10 minutes</p>\n<hr />\n<p>With a rapid change of your form, you take on a monstrous form for an instant before shifting back. When you Demoralize, you can choose to replace the auditory trait and with the visual trait. You can then attempt a demoralize check against each enemy that can see you within 30 feet.</p>\n"
